.TH "GMB" "1" "Sep 2026" "GlassMarble 1.1.0" "GlassMarble Manual"

.SH NAME
gmb-doc - Documentation Intelligence Engine — generate and maintain living docs


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgmb doc [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
The GlassMarble Documentation Intelligence Engine maintains living markdown
documents that are grounded in the Architecture Knowledge Graph (AKG).

.PP
Grounding is 100% deterministic (AKG, AST, commit reasoning) — but writing
the documentation is the LLM's job: every section is a real explanation in
plain English, backed by a grounded reference table underneath. Generation
requires a working LLM provider (run 'gmb ai configure' if you haven't set
one up); pass --no-llm to explicitly generate the grounding data alone as
plain reference tables, with no prose, instead.

.PP
Documents are section-targeted and delta-driven: only sections whose AKG
subgraph changed since the last run are ever re-rendered. Everything else
produces zero git diff.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB--bg\fP[=false]
	Run in background (non-blocking post-commit mode)

.PP
\fB--branch-policy\fP="main-only"
	When to write: main-only|any|tag-only

.PP
\fB--commit\fP=""
	Commit hash to process (default: HEAD)

.PP
\fB--doc\fP=""
	Only process the document with this ID

.PP
\fB--force\fP[=false]
	Bypass fast-bail and reprocess all documents

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for doc

.PP
\fB--json\fP[=false]
	Emit machine-readable JSON output

.PP
\fB--no-llm\fP[=false]
	Use deterministic renderer only (offline mode)

.PP
\fB--tag\fP=""
	Only process documents with this tag

.PP
\fB--write\fP[=false]
	Force writes even on non-main branches (overrides --branch-policy, except draft/wip)


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--color\fP="auto"
	Color output mode: auto|always|never

.PP
\fB-c\fP, \fB--config\fP=""
	Config file path (default is $HOME/.glassmarble.yaml)

.PP
\fB--debug\fP[=false]
	Enable debug logging

.PP
\fB--dir\fP=""
	Target repository directory for analysis and queries

.PP
\fB--max-json-mb\fP=0
	Refuse to load or commit an AKG state file (akg.json) larger than this many MiB (0 = unlimited)

.PP
\fB-q\fP, \fB--quiet\fP[=false]
	Suppress non-error output

.PP
\fB-v\fP, \fB--verbose\fP[=false]
	Verbose output logging


.SH EXAMPLE
.EX
  # Update all dirty managed documents for HEAD
  gmb doc

  # Scaffold a new living document
  gmb doc init docs/auth.md

  # CI freshness check (exits 1 if drift detected)
  gmb doc check

  # Preview what would change without writing
  gmb doc diff docs/auth.md

  # Dashboard of all managed docs with freshness scores
  gmb doc status

  # Generate migration guide between two git refs
  gmb doc release v1.1.0..v1.2.0

  # Export RAG-ready chunked knowledge base
  gmb doc export --format rag
.EE


